/* ── Footer, clinical pass (24 Oct 2026) ───────────────────────────────────
   Michael: "plus clinique, les codes des sites tech du moment, la typo est
   trop petite". One 12-column grid: the brand column (promise, then the
   two actions) on columns 1-4, four link columns on 5-12.
